      }
    ],
    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 74,
        "text": "Your table contains several zeros. Do they all mean the same thing?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "827faa5d04eb263c6dbe71855ff0b04b6194ccb3d852a8d32965ce80eae3d0cf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 81,
        "sourceEnd": 168,
        "text": "I used zero when a shop reported no customers, and also when the form was not returned.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "c244929987d7b91f9f0074d008277d8192297cfb88063c5ea139f8000221374a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 176,
        "sourceEnd": 256,
        "text": "Those are different. One is an observed count; the other is missing information.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "b7eca933d9be26f036f069148b6fdf3b409f9fb011ed1a95c2d12a8a79b2a90b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 263,
        "sourceEnd": 451,
        "text": "I will label the unreturned forms as missing and recalculate the average using the available observations. But I should not imply that those observations represent every shop equally well.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "20bcafd782322c33dc71eca317944ee6739d35f6adcf5d15b42af9fff414bc99",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 459,
        "sourceEnd": 495,
        "text": "Exactly. How many forms are missing?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "ce617ceea4be9bd2acae06bf6c6b0f1688dbaa7d499175146e6598ebec39ecbe",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 502,
        "sourceEnd": 607,
        "text": "Seven out of thirty. Four came from the eastern district, where some shops closed early during roadworks.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "f955e0f048c99997be813f607265c3b2f7588ac6cb817b604f0f249e741a66b3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 615,
        "sourceEnd": 641,
        "text": "Could that pattern matter?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "34bb135cc15779a98a713a677c0b0112cc03bbf6cd06f022116cadda6cbdd675",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 648,
        "sourceEnd": 796,
        "text": "Yes. Non-response may be related to trading conditions. It is not necessarily random, so deleting the missing rows could leave a misleading picture.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "d2834195803a319fa084a6635c1e849cfef1e29dda95ca09a7aa5b3ed22fc518",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 804,
        "sourceEnd": 849,
        "text": "Will you invent values to complete the table?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "2ecad55cbafa884a9dc0b9b104f0721a72e91ea159b4040eafe0d670cc5932ab",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 856,
        "sourceEnd": 1044,
        "text": "No. I can show a sensitivity check: what happens to the overall result under clearly stated low and high assumptions for the missing shops. Those are scenarios, not recovered observations.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "8c95cd4a3d518ab74a419e324e95b4b12d0d59ba6de7198e13963f747c92a10e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1052,
        "sourceEnd": 1079,
        "text": "What will the headline say?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "93b12a029b09b2bb5f803de99fa7bb57198e175f93dfd7ce03c4054d3d6e19a3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 1086,
        "sourceEnd": 1299,
        "text": "Average customer count among responding shops, with the response total beside it. I will also describe the concentration of missing forms in the east. The limitation belongs with the result, not hidden at the end.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "70bbfc9ab578dcfe11dc6d01c18d181179a9a6c76da2d3c99f9399b2fe8818bd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
